      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "t02_09",
      "hash64": "B8FB8FABB6AECF85",
      "text": "J’ai enfin reçu l’Anti-Para que j’avais commandé !\\c\\nJe vais pouvoir soigner mon Pokémon de\\nsa paralysie !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "t02_10",
      "hash64": "B8FEFCABB6B1BE93",
      "text": "Le Pokémon en tête d’équipe est le premier à\\nêtre envoyé au combat ! Voilà, tu sais tout !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "t02_11",
      "hash64": "B8FEFBABB6B1BCE0",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "t02_12",
      "hash64": "B8FEFEABB6B1C1F9",
      "text": "À en juger par ton uniforme, tu dois être\\nétudiant[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e ? Écoute donc mon bon conseil...\\c\\nTu peux transporter jusqu’à six Pokémon, alors\\nn’hésite pas à remplir ton équipe au maximum.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "t02_13",
      "hash64": "B8FEFDABB6B1C046",
      "text": "Eh ben moi, à l’école, j’apprends plein de trucs\\nsur les Pokémon d’abord !\\c\\nJ’ai appris qu’ils pouvaient connaître jusqu’à\\nquatre capacités ! Tu le savais pas, ça, hein ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "t02_14",
      "hash64": "B8FF00ABB6B1C55F",
      "text": "Comme on habite à Plato Real, on peut pas\\nloger au campus.\\c\\nDu coup, on doit se taper tout le trajet à pied.\\nAvec la côte, là, j’te raconte pas la fatigue...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "t02_15",
      "hash64": "B8FEFFABB6B1C3AC",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
