      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "t02_21",
      "hash64": "B8F48BABB6A8AA0B",
      "text": "Tu sais quoi ? On m’a dit que Bekipan transportait\\ndes colis et des lettres dans son bec !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "t02_22",
      "hash64": "B8F48CABB6A8ABBE",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "t02_23",
      "hash64": "B8F48DABB6A8AD71",
      "text": "Tu te rends à l’école ? Surtout, pense à bien\\nsauvegarder ta progression, c’est important.\\c\\nSur ce, bon vent !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "t02_24",
      "hash64": "B8F48EABB6A8AF24",
      "text": "Ici, c’est Plato Real. C’est une ville paisible où\\nle bonheur nous est servi sur un plateau.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
